hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"19000","Muhammad ibn Ubayd narrated to us, Umar from the family of Hudhayfah narrated to us, from al-Shabi, from Dihyah al-Kalbi, he said: I said: O Messenger of Allah, shall I not carry for you a donkey upon a horse, so it produces a mule for you to ride He said: Only those who do not know do that."
